# modules/eudr-due-diligence

- Feature root for AOI assessment, Hansen/JRC/S2 tiles, map UI, DD storage payloads.
- Shim: `src/features/eudr-due-diligence/**` → edit files under `modules/eudr-due-diligence/`.
- Server action entry still: `src/actions/eudr-due-diligence.ts` (not moved).
- Related workflow libs: `modules/eudr/` + rule `module-eudr.mdc`.
- Routes stay in `src/app/EUDR/**` — use `app-eudr.mdc` bridge.
- Preserve uncommitted AOI/risultato work; do not rewrite business logic while relocating.

## File map (Grep the symbol, then read only its range — never the whole file)

Large files (>400 lines):
- `src/actions/eudr-due-diligence.ts` (~700) — server actions. Pipeline: `runDueDiligenceWithNormalized` (~320 lines: lock/cooldown, buffer points, EE assessment, map PNG, storage, metadata). Entry points: `runDueDiligenceAoiAnalysis` (inline GeoJSON), `runDueDiligenceAoiAnalysisFromStorage` (staged upload > `AOI_INLINE_MAX_BYTES`), `stageDueDiligenceAoiForSession`, `getDueDiligenceArtifactUrl`. Helpers: `bufferedAnalysisGeometries`, `renderAoiMapPng`, `persistAoiMapPng`, `clearDdAnalysisLock`.
- `EmbeddedDueDiligenceBlock.tsx` (~725) — upload/run UI, one big component `EmbeddedDueDiligenceBlock`. File parsing helpers at top: `mergeGeoJsonFiles`, `featuresFromGeoJsonRoot`, `hasPointLikeGeometry`, `normalizeCuttingDateIso`; run handler `confirmAndRun`.
- `aoiRiskGate.ts` (~490) — "accettabile / non accettabile" gate + tendenza. Key: `buildDdLastRunSnapshot`, `applyAoiGateToEudrRiskResult`, `applyTendenzaRuleToSnapshot`, `alignReportGateWithSnapshot`, `hasLossFromCalendarYearInclusive`, `lossyearBandToCalendarYear`, `AOI_GATE_*` constants. Tests: `aoiRiskGate.test.ts`.
- `map/DueDiligenceMap.tsx` (~430) — MapLibre map, bounds/focus helpers.

Earth Engine (`server/earthengine/`):
- `runEudrAoiAssessment.ts` — JRC GFC2020 ∩ Hansen via batched `reduceRegions` (`reduceBatchOrSplit`, `reduceSubtypes`); result type `EudrAoiAssessmentResult`.
- `runForestLossForAoi.ts` — Hansen-only histogram (`runForestLossHistogramForAoi`).
- `aoiMapLayerSpecs.ts` — shared layer/vis specs for tiles and poster PNG (`composeAoiPosterEeImage`).
- `get*Tiles.ts` — tile URL builders (Hansen, JRC 2020, Sentinel-2 years). `initialize.ts` — EE auth. `normalizeAoi.ts` — GeoJSON → geometry.

Geometry & parsing:
- `prepareAoiGeometry.ts` — simplify (~15 m), round, batch (`batchAoiGeometries`, `AOI_BATCH_MAX_*`), bbox area, `simplifyUploadedFeatureCollection`. Tests alongside.
- `parseGeoJsonText.ts` — BOM-safe JSON parse.

Storage & types:
- `storage/paths.ts` (all bucket paths), `buildDdReportPayload.ts` (report JSON v2), `ddReplicatePayload.ts`, `loadDdLastRunFromStorage.ts` (`resolveDdLastRun`), `cleanupSessionRuns.ts`.
- `types/due-diligence-run.ts` — `RunMetadata`, `LossYearHistogram`.
- `constants/` — Hansen version/colors, gate thresholds.
